    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:96bf21e1-d868-4c24-927f-a3e147f566c8",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "96bf21e1-d868-4c24-927f-a3e147f566c8",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "- 维护部门：IT 网络支持组",
      "evidence_sha256": "4a501db2c36936871c252f12576597bb4e7f7c8be3c75e2ef3b3eb43aa215eac",
      "position": 6
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:8e1d0df0-1205-4800-93a5-c7d068cf7c39",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "8e1d0df0-1205-4800-93a5-c7d068cf7c39",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "- 适用范围：虚构公司的受管办公电脑和员工远程办公场景。",
      "evidence_sha256": "7677a9241aebeb026d91a59cf25b1320d338a220801b50ee23aa21421e86c3a4",
      "position": 7
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:94ae032c-b0de-4cdd-bdb9-8d83866e2fa3",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "94ae032c-b0de-4cdd-bdb9-8d83866e2fa3",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "NET-01：办公无线网络接入",
      "evidence_sha256": "b4488066f774ad8fbb1d5651b5a91080d3e47a424f730979481237e3db6ae955",
      "position": 8
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:13970953-9a52-46dc-adeb-b97b12402bf6",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "13970953-9a52-46dc-adeb-b97b12402bf6",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "员工办公无线网络名称为 Nebula-Staff，使用统一账号和密码登录。首次连接前，必须通过“软件中心 → 网络组件”安装公司无线网络证书。",
      "evidence_sha256": "a66ef33014986d412a30992c856ac13549751f8b4f8c6f347f82fb5a583e1581",
      "position": 9
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:8218101a-253f-4cb0-9812-7851ec3c68bf",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "8218101a-253f-4cb0-9812-7851ec3c68bf",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "访客无线网络名称为 Nebula-Guest，由会议或接待负责人在前台申请临时连接码。访客网络只能访问互联网，不能访问公司共享文件夹或内部业务系统。员工不得把 Nebula-Staff 的账号凭据提供给访客。",
      "evidence_sha256": "502f36192e5967169690a9db2d7096dee286d031392b4f17299499c0011502f8",
      "position": 10
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:e2d2ebeb-c622-42c1-b4c0-e01d84486773",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "e2d2ebeb-c622-42c1-b4c0-e01d84486773",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "NET-02：首次使用远程 VPN",
      "evidence_sha256": "b38cf49ad8956131191af12f3bac75de9cbc0ee8a27ea476bbad0a140db4f9c8",
      "position": 11
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:7f8c1031-a64f-408c-a733-50c5e52a5f64",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "7f8c1031-a64f-408c-a733-50c5e52a5f64",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "远程 VPN 仅允许受管电脑连接。员工先通过软件中心安装 Nebula Connect 客户端，再由直属主管审批远程访问申请；IT 根据批准的访问范围开通权限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "cba19395937ae9c8e1410629cfc67f8652587f30a8db754418e066fc497381f8",
      "position": 12
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:e4931928-f90e-417c-92ea-fa39b598d331",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "e4931928-f90e-417c-92ea-fa39b598d331",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "登录 VPN 使用统一账号、密码和多因素认证。连接成功只表示进入获准的网络范围，不代表自动获得所有内部应用或共享文件夹的权限。资源权限仍需由对应负责人批准。",
      "evidence_sha256": "a10f7f027c44e313b1b3272377ea510b60de68508e95dab08da2a6cc39511b86",
      "position": 13
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:792665db-73d4-43a4-bedb-209b4fb445bb",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "792665db-73d4-43a4-bedb-209b4fb445bb",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "NET-03：VPN 连接失败的处理顺序",
      "evidence_sha256": "0a2537df766ffceff6749f0aa89c6ab361a8e662b9dd134900e77e537c524a7c",
      "position": 14
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:c6484590-be27-4946-b953-f533a2efd29f",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "c6484590-be27-4946-b953-f533a2efd29f",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "VPN 连接失败时，先确认普通互联网访问正常，再检查 Nebula Connect 是否为软件中心发布的当前版本，更新后重新登录。",
      "evidence_sha256": "85f0ee6c98e1468c94d5a62860d25230a23be75dbc0bfe4a55a87fb97f52e6cd",
      "position": 15
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:3d887bb6-d27a-4f3f-9f49-67c0e7c958a6",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "3d887bb6-d27a-4f3f-9f49-67c0e7c958a6",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "若提示身份验证失败，应检查统一账号是否锁定、密码是否正确及多因素认证是否完成。账号锁定、密码重置和认证设备重绑的流程，见《统一账号与多因素认证操作手册》。",
      "evidence_sha256": "cd4d254e899622256b4527031397d9bc137bfa3b784d5375d1d6adf0bb6b4120",
      "position": 16
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:1bb2bcc0-9f33-49cb-8ec3-6f54fe96739d",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "1bb2bcc0-9f33-49cb-8ec3-6f54fe96739d",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "仍无法连接时，提交“远程网络故障”工单，附错误码、发生时间和客户端版本。不要提交密码、验证码或认证器动态口令。",
      "evidence_sha256": "dd84d54eece49504e7a23bb192d1a2fc9baeda68f128d0b475aa1d2d9abb6edf",
      "position": 17
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:969d7e43-4982-4a8d-9cd2-54100f6c13dc",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "969d7e43-4982-4a8d-9cd2-54100f6c13dc",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "若 VPN 显示已连接但共享目录提示“无权限”，应核查共享文件夹授权，不应仅因该提示重复重装 VPN。",
      "evidence_sha256": "f28ad64f2db64b1ea614c69298c9198993515b59ff152e6d968b9e7d2be6e6a3",
      "position": 18
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:e913381f-7c2f-4b71-a6c4-0bbdfe15124c",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "e913381f-7c2f-4b71-a6c4-0bbdfe15124c",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "NET-04：VPN 已连接但无法打开内部站点",
      "evidence_sha256": "c1d076cfc68e8a15f0c1b9b7a448f061016c84ff60652d6c540793fe788c723b",
      "position": 19
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:a9a2f788-94e5-4398-acda-f3f2c2d7c7bb",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "a9a2f788-94e5-4398-acda-f3f2c2d7c7bb",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "先确认无法访问的站点是否在已批准范围内。受管电脑上的 DNS 设置应保持公司管理策略，不得自行替换为公共 DNS 来绕过问题。",
      "evidence_sha256": "95324a416e85cc23378db36f14da2e8e6d3a19710de00c24bdb4afd4833dca05",
      "position": 20
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:225818a9-e7a5-496c-8209-290a91d3e4fa",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "225818a9-e7a5-496c-8209-290a91d3e4fa",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "提交工单时提供站点名称、访问时间、错误提示，以及“其他内部站点是否可访问”的结果。对于没有授权的资源，应走资源权限申请流程，不能要求网络组直接扩大权限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "1878aa19e0eef8329e4d7c57ae2594c9c0504cd0016cb00d68fb73cf354a902a",
      "position": 21
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:912e49b8-e6e3-45c5-b000-0aa3e3ec816c",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "912e49b8-e6e3-45c5-b000-0aa3e3ec816c",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "NET-05：会议室投屏",
      "evidence_sha256": "8709fcb4c5272bfd771910d5afe7a4ffa17dbff6bd8a16978e4866dda0f86567",
      "position": 22
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:b32aaa2b-5709-46db-a874-c81289b6967d",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "b32aaa2b-5709-46db-a874-c81289b6967d",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "会议室投屏应连接该会议室提供的无线网络，再在投屏客户端输入会议室屏幕显示的 6 位连接码。投屏码只用于当前会议室连接，不是统一账号密码。",
      "evidence_sha256": "fa5fe2e8777cd5cfd4fcaa753a8d7cee3b4298920acd80dbd5119f9d513ed575",
      "position": 23
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:ef3d4f35-a2d5-427c-8b71-302b21b0cbb2",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "ef3d4f35-a2d5-427c-8b71-302b21b0cbb2",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "没有画面时，先检查屏幕输入源和电脑所连网络，再重新输入屏幕当前显示的连接码。",
      "evidence_sha256": "386e4e9b75aebad088eaab0223023233a0469aed537c342e5334c405504b6f91",
      "position": 24
    },
    {
