      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "1af5b4fd-9341-44e7-981a-3a46bc19cd56",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "NET-06：支持范围与资料边界",
      "evidence_sha256": "ff2bc0dda1d26208af8eb528bd5341ba71a6b5e27f7c18ab287031c4b8509f21",
      "position": 25
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:86328643-fab8-4268-839f-7abf3f8ca53d",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "86328643-fab8-4268-839f-7abf3f8ca53d",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "网络支持组人工服务时间为工作日 09:00—18:00，时区为北京时间。连接码、证书和软件应通过公司指定入口获取。",
      "evidence_sha256": "e8da7403d6a3f7137b9c615cda4fd77e72e456850b7a30268bc5de8fd34caba5",
      "position": 26
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69:55fa460a-fec5-4a89-936f-4ec21fca4f84",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "dfc9f89f-4dd6-4a58-b564-9c6162958d69",
      "segment_id": "55fa460a-fec5-4a89-936f-4ec21fca4f84",
      "source_document": "02-network-and-vpn.txt",
      "content": "本文没有提供 VPN 出口国家列表、带宽保证值、个人设备 VPN 安装办法或供应商网络接入政策。不得把“允许远程访问”解释为允许访问任何地区或任何内部资源。",
      "evidence_sha256": "501300b8eb9147d4382c17ee771910fb68346b9d0cffd470502d0ad75d19cfa9",
      "position": 27
    },
