    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:2d6ad2c4-36f9-4340-aa4f-980a948de309",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "2d6ad2c4-36f9-4340-aa4f-980a948de309",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "- 维护部门：IT 服务台",
      "evidence_sha256": "b016f53688624248f0d58527d5851f35883d20a0eb2b38ecf38b2830b46398d9",
      "position": 6
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:ac5abdad-9504-42d2-9a2b-4f2593ebf08f",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "ac5abdad-9504-42d2-9a2b-4f2593ebf08f",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "- 适用范围：虚构公司的在职员工统一账号；不适用于客户账号和外部供应商账号。",
      "evidence_sha256": "12c98d3a98dfabac7c316cefe897142e0002ecea1349bf6b06815f363c64c427",
      "position": 7
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:f6e633af-a115-4f7e-a69a-95ccabb0a233",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "f6e633af-a115-4f7e-a69a-95ccabb0a233",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "ACC-01：忘记密码如何重置",
      "evidence_sha256": "66abdda0a4690556aab8864d63ef5c4f839c9b0777bf4d9812f7f9623909be92",
      "position": 8
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:1226c45c-3a34-4271-9c44-59be3cf308f0",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "1226c45c-3a34-4271-9c44-59be3cf308f0",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "员工忘记统一账号密码时，进入“服务门户 → 账号服务 → 密码重置”，输入员工编号，使用已绑定手机收到的短信验证码验证身份。验证通过后设置新密码，再使用新密码登录。",
      "evidence_sha256": "dc3be05827be968acdaeb1ff1f29fc59c6dd057469c0ce4a8bb318d93a000c65",
      "position": 9
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:e032a235-d315-44cf-9c13-ae416d3809ff",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "e032a235-d315-44cf-9c13-ae416d3809ff",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "新密码至少 12 位，必须同时包含大写字母、小写字母、数字和特殊字符，且不得与最近 5 次使用过的密码相同。短信验证码有效期为 5 分钟。",
      "evidence_sha256": "45eea4dde8d913f76537417fcdaca6d4cbb7e0fc7038dd2c10183faf4927c02e",
      "position": 10
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:9b36d268-9fb7-4cd7-aae7-34ade372e0db",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "9b36d268-9fb7-4cd7-aae7-34ade372e0db",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "员工无法接收绑定手机的验证码时，不得借用其他员工的验证码。应在服务门户选择“人工身份核验”，提交员工编号和可联系时间，由服务台通过已登记的工作联系方式回访。本文不规定人工身份核验完成时限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "5d5d58ac68fe9f4eb3e2a51758775a065d3e533dcbccfb239ba9d841514fff18",
      "position": 11
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:7c75c3e8-d104-471e-ad22-3678c9ae1191",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "7c75c3e8-d104-471e-ad22-3678c9ae1191",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "ACC-02：账号锁定与解锁",
      "evidence_sha256": "1f92a9d5bf4a5f22597d69ef2a6dab9c8eda52e8899cad023569c8ea1c6aace7",
      "position": 12
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:446f3ab8-eaea-4296-b005-3d6cc6186dcd",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "446f3ab8-eaea-4296-b005-3d6cc6186dcd",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "连续输错密码 5 次，账号会锁定 15 分钟，期间继续尝试登录不会提前解锁。员工可等待自动解锁，或提交“账号解锁”工单，由服务台完成身份核验后处理。",
      "evidence_sha256": "0510875f558c848cb6aa430543745f5c126a3a3ae47e478b355e6f898bad2d3b",
      "position": 13
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:dd416d3b-3676-40cc-94b3-defc99f10351",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "dd416d3b-3676-40cc-94b3-defc99f10351",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "解锁不等于密码重置。员工仍不知道原密码时，应按照 ACC-01 重置密码。",
      "evidence_sha256": "4e762be25361910cfe510a7f6df0812a650a8913d37fbcb381cf4b4fa6b572ce",
      "position": 14
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:d5109224-92bd-4de7-bdcd-39339244cdf4",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "d5109224-92bd-4de7-bdcd-39339244cdf4",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "ACC-03：更换多因素认证手机",
      "evidence_sha256": "4de3501b82e13c1b81acfdf5e91842df21efe08c8a77855f71ea880007aa5192",
      "position": 15
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:f299edf1-ef28-4c41-b529-e1b3053d5f06",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "f299edf1-ef28-4c41-b529-e1b3053d5f06",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "旧手机仍可使用时，先打开“安全中心 → 多因素认证 → 添加设备”，在新手机完成绑定并通过一次验证，再移除旧手机。必须先验证新设备，再删除旧设备，避免失去登录方式。",
      "evidence_sha256": "20ea08141c99c120efa298e3a251d353801f1529b53d2d61cf7873b54e950472",
      "position": 16
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:c21186ee-5c10-464d-b8f1-39813bd53a43",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "c21186ee-5c10-464d-b8f1-39813bd53a43",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "旧手机丢失或损坏、无法完成验证时，联系服务台申请“认证设备重绑”，完成身份核验后由服务台清除旧绑定，再由员工注册新设备。服务台不会要求员工提供密码、短信验证码或认证器动态口令。",
      "evidence_sha256": "295700501081ad9f493788647bb9bc35a7529eea8b304e447827c9288672c16c",
      "position": 17
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:3825702c-9132-41e6-a722-7eb19319afd1",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "3825702c-9132-41e6-a722-7eb19319afd1",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "ACC-04：软件安装与管理员权限",
      "evidence_sha256": "eb99386eceb88581725596702e629eb7ac8116f6e4993d72f02ea9c051e08bce",
      "position": 18
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:b73a6875-5623-4e65-8abe-37bc24afd81b",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "b73a6875-5623-4e65-8abe-37bc24afd81b",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "安装工作软件前，在“服务门户 → 软件申请”提交软件名称、工作用途和所需版本，由直属主管审批。审批通过后由 IT 执行安装；员工不得自行获取本地管理员权限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "f015399a0fe8384694876785fc7dfd40ea6d366bd37b13da9ac8f5d3cf86c5c0",
      "position": 19
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:4b5d8c07-9c4d-46f8-b504-0964f0832829",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "4b5d8c07-9c4d-46f8-b504-0964f0832829",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "直属主管负责审批业务用途，IT 负责安装与技术检查。不能把“IT 执行安装”理解为“IT 代替主管审批”。本文不规定软件申请从提交到安装完成的统一时限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "1dc05006269cc763afac3240468299dbde4294729013022bd2c223f4f1d95cc0",
      "position": 20
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:aa1dbc72-0571-4005-846e-e21fd5e9ddaf",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "aa1dbc72-0571-4005-846e-e21fd5e9ddaf",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "ACC-05：服务时间与资料边界",
      "evidence_sha256": "32b2ef8c15ff31b093adf60e6f1bcaabd82565581071a7f9a06cc0b3d30f70b0",
      "position": 21
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:47753209-cd67-4bdf-a676-571b025669fc",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "47753209-cd67-4bdf-a676-571b025669fc",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "IT 服务台人工服务时间为工作日 09:00—18:00，时区为北京时间；自助密码重置入口全天可用。人工服务时间不等于工单解决时限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "5be6881d4afc83e8e18f1ea2599891201849bcb8d45f313caf6fb14e8433812f",
      "position": 22
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3:303f5fbe-e9e6-4696-b9d5-ef1510aa147e",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "495099d9-1572-4f84-b483-e70768cefad3",
      "segment_id": "303f5fbe-e9e6-4696-b9d5-ef1510aa147e",
      "source_document": "01-account-and-mfa.txt",
      "content": "本文没有规定客户账号的密码策略、访客账号申请规则、员工年假政策或软件采购报销标准，不能从本文推断这些事项。",
      "evidence_sha256": "c0dfb2c2968c8323e086dac76e3c9e6fd1fcc5a9bedd4b63898863758150f19c",
      "position": 23
    },
