      "segment_id": "b97327ea-90d4-4022-ba7a-3fa35cf439ea",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "- 适用范围：虚构公司的团队网盘和受管共享文件夹；不适用于个人电脑本地磁盘或私人网盘。",
      "evidence_sha256": "dc4b7d09a0fa701e80b0ccf2404e60f49078c764fe64db585f55bd9d68044b0a",
      "position": 7
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:e1940c65-be43-4d6d-a759-1298d5594c47",
