      "segment_id": "e1940c65-be43-4d6d-a759-1298d5594c47",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "FILE-01：共享文件夹权限申请",
      "evidence_sha256": "a0cb74f363e366fea70caf946843ac429f6f84a98c95e6ed446e640496e30016",
      "position": 8
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:c021c65d-7e16-48b6-aab7-6bd2769856dc",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "c021c65d-7e16-48b6-aab7-6bd2769856dc",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "申请共享文件夹权限时，在“服务门户 → 存储服务 → 共享权限”提交完整目录路径、申请原因、只读或读写级别，以及需要访问的人员名单。",
      "evidence_sha256": "766c8b7f4ce7ea3cb8b2d4f3a4d735d94344e7b975638cdc7c11214fdfe97e86",
      "position": 9
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:939e6430-8f83-4907-97ad-b409e4132bdd",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "939e6430-8f83-4907-97ad-b409e4132bdd",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "审批人为该文件夹的业务负责人。审批通过后，由 IT 在 1 个工作日内开通。这个时限从业务负责人审批完成时开始计算，不从员工提交申请时计算。",
      "evidence_sha256": "e48774d486506a79b6ad4604c11446d8c1cae3cf8adc01d6d62b69dd25d4e0d4",
      "position": 10
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:acc3177c-b366-456e-9084-e8a61d4e1a10",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "acc3177c-b366-456e-9084-e8a61d4e1a10",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "IT 负责执行授权，不代替业务负责人审批。直属主管批准 VPN 访问，也不自动等于文件夹业务负责人批准共享权限。",
      "evidence_sha256": "357a2e31045aeeaa604fb648786810d20094d8c1acbec34bb1867754db75ebbb",
      "position": 11
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:383c7dbd-a31d-4b61-96b4-d70ff03a0386",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "383c7dbd-a31d-4b61-96b4-d70ff03a0386",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "FILE-02：只读与读写权限",
      "evidence_sha256": "7eb1b8fd86cdbba8c63a8ae191ac00d4d4e53368168a6e4361b555e58eb68a38",
      "position": 12
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:9b35887a-cb3b-45c8-88ae-5676dfa8e36a",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "9b35887a-cb3b-45c8-88ae-5676dfa8e36a",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "只读权限允许查看和下载文件，不允许修改、上传或删除。读写权限允许在授权目录中创建和修改文件，并按该目录策略执行删除。",
      "evidence_sha256": "8d9d05b646d61b3988d292e3993605910dac572db3f4bedd4d8e49806f5e446a",
      "position": 13
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:0a6750ed-1f1d-417e-b9db-77e870c22909",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "0a6750ed-1f1d-417e-b9db-77e870c22909",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "需要扩大权限范围或从只读改成读写时，必须重新提交申请。权限不随文件链接转发而转移；没有授权的员工即使收到链接，也应被拒绝访问。",
      "evidence_sha256": "0dd6097611539c65bb2998e5bf168600fae37893f789ea8d2dfa856716eb1a1d",
      "position": 14
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:a71a1fd4-719a-44c5-bc25-95563ad89a90",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "a71a1fd4-719a-44c5-bc25-95563ad89a90",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "FILE-03：团队网盘误删文件恢复",
      "evidence_sha256": "975e97cc3b5a9c3dd6e2dcd5152091e47e0b513b26df5d9c84feb6c1d8a8be83",
      "position": 15
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:81e40ac5-13c9-4392-b51d-773d65de4d68",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "81e40ac5-13c9-4392-b51d-773d65de4d68",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "团队网盘文件删除后进入回收站，自删除时间起保留 30 天。员工可在“团队网盘 → 回收站”找到文件并恢复。这里的 30 天是自然日，不是工作日。",
      "evidence_sha256": "77d28469b51e445cc714c732338d9f01e7fa7a47f1d11a67eeaccc3192bb5dcc",
      "position": 16
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:6b99ccf3-c340-453a-bbd8-fb510446c5df",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "6b99ccf3-c340-453a-bbd8-fb510446c5df",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "文件已从回收站清空或删除超过 30 天时，不能保证自助恢复。应提交“文件恢复”工单，提供原目录、文件名和大致删除时间，由 IT 检查是否存在可用备份。",
      "evidence_sha256": "9ec1fa81e230f66e868cb69584942264fc6029ceafb6fa8510661e17673cfeb4",
      "position": 17
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:da78d263-a1d0-4f69-95bc-c7c4016616fe",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "da78d263-a1d0-4f69-95bc-c7c4016616fe",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "常规备份保留期为 90 天，但这不代表任何文件在 90 天内都一定可以恢复：备份中可能没有该文件，或该版本未被成功备份。回收站 30 天保留期与备份 90 天保留期是不同机制。",
      "evidence_sha256": "2c2727182a56e8168fbc4c95ff858374576c5e6992fd1b41a435fc1b374bf7e5",
      "position": 18
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:fc2fd751-8c2a-42bb-96aa-fc65fbf4c097",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "fc2fd751-8c2a-42bb-96aa-fc65fbf4c097",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "FILE-04：文件版本恢复",
      "evidence_sha256": "1970ed1aa7c9d5cc50f6895c66f97450438205298e14f44936060583b50f056f",
      "position": 19
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:a592aa1e-137b-49f4-8c9b-136a91a4766e",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
      "document_id": "759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148",
      "segment_id": "a592aa1e-137b-49f4-8c9b-136a91a4766e",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "团队网盘可保留最近 20 个历史版本。员工可在文件详情中的“版本历史”查看并恢复已有版本。版本数量上限不等于固定天数，不能据此推断“可恢复最近 20 天”。",
      "evidence_sha256": "653e5307a1222af75eb513ef00051a33138f9c3e25c71f9bde1bcbe24b1a3d1b",
      "position": 20
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:60c66e9f-8674-41b4-a12a-d9de9d496ab8",
      "dataset_id": "d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688",
