      "segment_id": "cba94e51-0544-40a7-8451-5c0599c79cf4",
      "source_document": "03-shared-files-and-recovery.txt",
      "content": "统一邮箱容量上限为 5GB。邮箱空间不足时，可清空已删除邮件和垃圾邮件，并将需要留存的大附件归档到有权限的团队网盘目录。",
      "evidence_sha256": "63284d1fdc3580d49a44029697a85bbf99fc5f3f6d072118779e87bb942268c2",
      "position": 23
    },
    {
      "stable_id": "dify:d97144f0-a39e-433b-aea3-5f4c935aa688:759c7ae2-7e71-4e5a-bd60-a4aa00c6e148:bb797349-0b25-461f-9f2d-e5129be7ace1",
